OL,3,GNEWSAFireworks campaigner makes direct
OL,4,Aappeal to Burnham
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Bradford woman who has campaigned for
OL,7,Falmost a decade against the anti-social
OL,8,Fuse of fireworks has said meeting the
OL,9,Fprime minister has given her fresh hope
OL,10,Fthat long-awaited action is finally
OL,11,Fwithin reach.
OL,13,FInayah Sher raised the issue directly
OL,14,Fwith Andy Burnham during his recent
OL,15,Fvisit to Bradford, where he launched a
OL,16,Fnational crackdown on illegal waste
OL,17,Fdumping.
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,382,380,200,160,0,100
