OL,3,GNEWSAFireworks campaigner makes direct
OL,4,Aappeal to Burnham
OL,5,
OL,6,FShe told him people across the district
OL,7,Fwere being subjected to fireworks late
OL,8,Fat night, as well as having to clean up
OL,9,Fthe debris left in neighbourhoods, and
OL,10,Fsaid the PM listened attentively to her
OL,11,Fconcerns.
OL,13,F"I spoke to him about the nuisance and
OL,14,Fmenace of fireworks, and I believe he
OL,15,Fis going to take action," she said.
